IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `wra-core`
IMPORT `wra3-pt4-s92`

-- Tests for wra3-pt4-s92.l4 (section 92(3)). Expected values are written from the text (raw lines 1488-1489), decided before running.

§ `s 92(3)(a) primary legislation`

#ASSERT `s 92(3)(a) the legislation is primary legislation` `s 92(3) an Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 92(3)(a) the legislation is primary legislation` `s 92(3) an Act of the Scottish Parliament` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 92(3)(a) the legislation is primary legislation` `s 92(3) an instrument made under primary legislation` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 92(3)(a) the legislation is primary legislation` `s 92(3) any other legislation` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 92(3)(b) secondary legislation`

#ASSERT `s 92(3)(b) the legislation is secondary legislation` `s 92(3) an instrument made under primary legislation` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 92(3)(b) the legislation is secondary legislation` `s 92(3) an Act` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 92(3)(b) the legislation is secondary legislation` `s 92(3) an Act of the Scottish Parliament` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 92(3)(b) the legislation is secondary legislation` `s 92(3) any other legislation` EQUALS JUST FALSE
